      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T14:33:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is *Graphite* treating it as red instead of alpha? Or do you am *I* doing something within this CL incorrectly that\u0027s leading to that behavior? That hunch would make sense, I just want to understand if that\u0027s expected at this stage of graphite development or not.",
