      "writtenOn": "2022-10-25T14:45:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My guess is that graphite\u0027s texture sampling is not set up to convey the SkColorType correctly in this case. In Ganesh we configure swizzles (either in hardware or as extra logic added in SkSL) to modify what\u0027s returned by a `sample` call. In this case, an R8 texture\u0027s value would be swizzled to `.rrrr` but w/o that it will just be `r000` I believe. Greg would know more.",
